# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# PAY_TO is the Base address that receives x402 overage (0.001 USDC per check).
# Leave it unset to return HTTP 402 payment_not_configured when the free cap is hit.
# PAY_TO=0xYourReceivingAddress
# BUNDLE_PROXY_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
